# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*

# NOTE: perf_model/results_*.txt are deliberately NOT ignored. They are the
# generated evidence behind claims in PHASE0_FINDINGS.md, and versioning them is
# how we see a number change and find out what changed it. That traceability is
# the whole reason this repo exists.
cpu_backend/*.exe
cpu_backend/problem.bin

# C++ build trees. The sources are tracked; the objects are not.
cpp/build*/

# Rust build output — see docs/findings/porting-the-core.md
native/**/target/
# native/expectations/*.json is COMMITTED, deliberately. It is generated from the shipped Python
# by native/expectations/all.py, and it is the only reference the Rust suite has for what that
# Python did — so the day the Python goes, the golden data has to already be data. 328 KB.
# `tests/test_expectations.py` holds it current while both implementations exist.

